2. **Full acceptance benchmark.** `engine_bench --suite acceptance` does not complete on DX12 or Vulkan. The render, streaming, all-features, and physics scenes do not yet produce GPU timestamps, so runs report `incomplete`. This is engineering work, not a rerun.
