4. **linux-gcc.** The local GCC 9.4 cannot build Jolt. The gate needs GCC 11 or newer.
5. **LICENSE.** The repository has no license file. This is your decision, so I did not add one.
6. **Visual smoke tests.** Windows has a launch-only screenshot. The full action sequence is not run, and Linux has no native run.
7. **Real sample-game package.** The packaging path is covered by the editor suite, but no package from a real game has been built on either OS.

